{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "2c3e07ee72d3c3d7e07af4dc762c601215861fab36eb633de6ecbc735e1e34f1", "ja": "びがっぷ、大反響！", "zh": "Big up，反响热烈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9635aa4d6350fb9eebfa75f9bc3148144957957955695006814e1b41f2ae3471", "ja": "サプライズライブは大成功！　天体公演も\n大きな話題を呼び、余韻に浸るメンバー達。\nそんな中、内緒でグッズ販売を企んでいたと\nバレた茜は、律子から逃げるはめになるの\nだった……あーる・あい・ぴー。", "zh": "惊喜演唱会大获成功！天体公演也引发了热烈话题，成员们沉浸在演出余韵之中。在这期间，茜偷偷策划销售周边的事被发现，只好开始躲避律子……安息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "42020ac3df3f4c51c4919cdbe7f7027f1387d5367c59416082d1ca4bf7897c2f", "ja": "（卒業式ライブは大成功！　そのままの勢いで、\n天体公演も大きな話題となった。ありがたい！）", "zh": "（毕业典礼公演大获成功！趁着这股势头，天体公演也引起了很大的话题。真是太感谢了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "7e83b9f472916a4adae6b3e5ab35ef01f7b10787f85c53ab375482a8272fbc43", "ja": "茜っち、環、せりりん！　本当にお疲れさま！\n天体公演、めちゃくちゃ盛り上がったね！", "zh": "茜茜、小环、星梨花！真的辛苦了！\n天体公演超级热闹吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "317a0aaf7c9249ac9b394bc9c42135ad18460a66d7f7af546d02c2a458fd2614", "ja": "海美さん、ありがとうございます！\nわたしもやっていて、とっても楽しかったです♪", "zh": "海美，谢谢你！\n我也参与其中，觉得特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "2e9eb2deb51fb81fd743d3c3e2118fe0a349821ad965b9bd9b5c296e70fde515", "ja": "たまきも！　お客さん達もみんな\n楽しそうだったし、これって大成功だよね？　くふふ！", "zh": "我也是！客人们看起来也都很开心，这次肯定大获成功了吧？咕呼呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "8622c0c2f2a3edff1d6402a94ef3531e4bfec70bf8149f7c8309d42d334c9f9d", "ja": "そうね、連日満席だったし。\nTV番組とのシナジーは、やっぱり強いわね～。", "zh": "是啊，连续好几天都是满座。\n和电视节目的联动，果然很强呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "22229488fb8f69da18e75cff5a6d4459905f3a645bd90c0796aae4c7a1c3cb84", "ja": "うんうん！　{$P$}ちゃんも\nこれなら、打ち上げ奮発してくれるよね？　ね？", "zh": "嗯嗯！{$P$}也会因为这样，给我们办一场丰盛的庆功宴吧？对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ef3c09989c1eb428062e1d291c3bb1d227cb00fa04aa3f655042e46ee13d1c90", "ja": "あ、ああ……わかった！　みんな、本当に頑張って\nくれたからな。期待してくれていいぞ！", "zh": "啊、啊啊……知道了！大家真的都努力了，所以尽管期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "d8f8879d0c16a8cca70f4abecf62e3461ccd5f48149cde094d92925de6643398", "ja": "ヤッター！　さすが{$P$}ちゃん、\n話がわかるぅ～、ニャハッ☆", "zh": "太棒啦！不愧是{$P$}，真懂我呀～呀哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "a0350f5c3c1a01ba8f8ec9937fa8da60e81098cd0fd09db2c7707f36952f886b", "ja": "あっ、そういえば茜っち、環、せりりん！\n番組見たよ！　あの、卒業式のスペシャル回。", "zh": "啊，对了，茜茜、环、星梨花！\n你们的节目我看了！就是那个毕业典礼的特别篇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "2d8b8be1d10ec4c5316c416336b033b79b6bbca6e48f497ac681f68c2c35e266", "ja": "もう、すっ………ごく感動しちゃって！\n私も卒業する時、あんな卒業式がいいなって思った！", "zh": "真的……太感动了！我也想在自己毕业的时候，办一场那样的毕业典礼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "597dbc998fdf07c4c742263615e53084fc94437d0aa5b55e6132746233504f8f", "ja": "そうそう。番組の放映があってから、うちの卒業式にも\n来てほしいって話が、何件か来てるんだよな。", "zh": "对对。节目播出之后，已经有好几处学校联系我们，\n希望你们也能来参加他们的毕业典礼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "af37fc5050fd2d30309e2ea45f310d4fae368537251832a27e27d361b8de1705", "ja": "えっ、それって……たまき達が、\nたくさんの卒業式に呼ばれるってこと？　楽しそう！", "zh": "诶，那就是说……环和大家要被邀请去参加好多毕业典礼？听起来好有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "fa0264e748fa7606928b46cf0214fd36d158a788451e1e384cf9c2cd0dd50bf1", "ja": "わたし達の『Sweet Sweet Soul』が、\n卒業ソングになったりとか……とっても素敵ですね。", "zh": "我们的《Sweet Sweet Soul》要是能变成\n毕业歌的话……那就太棒了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "a1a8516ad3127f1a15c33d5e27ced5a293b9fbf97a357ec90781edcfea653ae7", "ja": "おおっ！　それ、新しい営業先ってことだよね？\nくんくん、これは……ビジネスチャンスの匂い！", "zh": "哦哦！也就是说，那就是新的业务拓展对象吧？  \n嗅嗅，这是……商机的味道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "6e640916a83a304a9f92dfaaeeae4ddaef6d98c96804ea1e51eba2c5c7da5a62", "ja": "卒業式の定番ユニットとして、\nグッズ類もそれに寄せたデザインで……。", "zh": "作为毕业典礼上的经典组合，周边商品也采用相应的设计……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b0e592c294bab85a4e6f90db77dcafd5d22cdf65677bc3861ef1a81a37a3cf91", "ja": "また何か企んで……まあでも今回は、茜のそういう\nビジネスの勘に救われたし、悪いばかりでもないな。", "zh": "又在盘算些什么了……不过话说回来，这次多亏了茜敏锐的商业直觉才化解了危机，倒也不能全算坏事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "cb5a7db0d84167ce63d242e4535fc71d0c9741f2527b6dfe70302e4f044fd039", "ja": "そうですね。私も、そういう方向性では負けないつもり\nでしたけど……茜、今回はお見事だったわ。", "zh": "是啊。我原本也没打算在这种方向上输给谁，\n不过……茜，这次你做得很出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "e0676eeb26a73e67a6c103c192adf92f91b3a3084612fbe6d77772ae89d1f23d", "ja": "特に、あの在校生たちの映像のアイディア。\nあれは称賛に値するわ。", "zh": "尤其是那段在校生影像的创意。那确实值得称赞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "4e56e14eef33ef8939996e6995a4406fe1e018beb818f11cf58269771dff454a", "ja": "おおっ！？　{$P$}ちゃんと\n律子さんが、珍しくべた褒め！", "zh": "哦哦！？{$P$}和律子小姐，难得把人夸得这么狠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "b2b96c455e4d954fe1a7ac7e98a90ffb47b3abd70676c573ec92d861b0c46329", "ja": "サプライズも公演も成功して……これはもう茜ちゃん、\n完・全・勝・利ってことだよね？　ニャハハーッ☆", "zh": "惊喜和公演都成功了……这下小茜就是完・全・胜・利了，对吧？　喵哈哈！☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "d9e284d8c3124abbf1e99c29352318b5be26732f1ab18159f4bc75b6feb52b8d", "ja": "そうですね！　後は、茜さんの新作グッズが\nたくさん売れたら、大、大、大成功、ですよね♪", "zh": "是啊！接下来只要茜小姐的新周边能卖出很多，那就是大、大、大成功了，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a59b3418694253ff7381dfee15ad30cf28f7125cca33f60600cf69ab23b9c784", "ja": "……新作グッズ？\nちょっと待って、それ何の話？", "zh": "……新作周边？\n等一下，你在说什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "6a40ba309af2f416e6ea1de20a5a2b0522d082ebdbf72143ab4b1ae7a516ca13", "ja": "ギ、ギニャ……！？\nせ、星梨花ちゃん！　その話は今はちょっと……！", "zh": "咕、咕喵……！？\n星梨花！那件事现在先别提……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "83c45862e621e8fef6bfc1d768c0b759baeb592824b694fa97f8e25e82419729", "ja": "あ、そういえばあかね、たまきのぬいぐるみは？\n作ってくれるって言ってたでしょー？", "zh": "啊，对了，茜，环的玩偶呢？\n你之前不是说会帮我做的吗——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "7e41e63fac4c263dfacc87e36a0bba74d2c0381a4d373187361069731bc7d9db", "ja": "ギニャーッ！？", "zh": "喵哇——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "413db9c2a2c4921a8a1f7c12c3a685d5561ca52c16b6d78f09a5f6565774a259", "ja": "……。\n茜？　まさか、また勝手にグッズを……？", "zh": "……。\n茜？难道你又擅自做周边……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "428882ef8a30d09650aac70bfae3f51a8cc5a70f4977588f7c511df64a829e40", "ja": "お、おーっと！　茜ちゃん、ここで\n急用を思い出しちゃった！　サラバダーッ！", "zh": "哎、哎呀！小茜，我突然想起还有急事！先闪啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "491a10bcfc54b39b49d4b98aeaf85441651dda56ec50248fc5e7b44ef628edbf", "ja": "こらーーーーーーっ！　待ちなさい！\nしっかり話、聞かせてもらいますからねっ！", "zh": "喂——！给我站住！我会好好听你把话说清楚的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "b284807fcb28a8595f529d4f4a7b07df65b0691965f30bd99d4e017322dd8a61", "ja": "くふふ♪　鬼ごっこになっちゃった！\n待って～！　たまきも追いかけるぞ～！", "zh": "咕呼呼♪　变成捉迷藏了！\n等等～！环也要追上去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "df95046ac9643a80f641cfdcd38c24d8d875cfa2b007c4c56e220c63ab4ea12f", "ja": "あはは、楽しそう！　じゃあ、私も～！\nせりりんも、一緒に行こうっ！　待て待て～！", "zh": "啊哈哈，看起来好好玩！那我也来～！\n星梨梨也一起去吧！等等我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "e44fc57533ae72457507f230621846eb2271bd212af1d8748822279e6fe393b8", "ja": "わわっ！　\n海美さん、環ちゃん、待ってください～！", "zh": "哇哇！\n海美小姐、环，等等我呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "7d8bf833a267650b4ef67896aa8418cad3b8070576d00ccf7505e851ee86bb5c", "ja": "（やれやれ……卒業というテーマに向き合って、少し\n大人びたような気もしたけど……茜はいつも通りだな）", "zh": "（真是的……虽然她面对“毕业”这个主题时，感觉似乎稍微成熟了一些……但茜还是一如既往啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
